# Reality Dissociation Syndrome Trait
trait-reality-dissociation-name = Reality Dissociation
trait-reality-dissociation-desc = You suffer from acute Reality Dissociation Syndrome. You periodically experience vivid client-exclusive hallucinations, phantom chatter from nearby crew and pets, fake radio emergencies, battle noises behind walls, and creeping illusions.

reality-dissociation-record-text = Patient suffers from Reality Dissociation Syndrome, manifesting in recurrent sensory, auditory, and visual hallucinations.

